  "notes": "Backlog game, all-AAA pass: picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year across all genres (docs/PLAN.md section 2, genre filter widened 2026-10-23). RAWG's first result is the expected entry (id 1682); RAWG also has a separate \"The Wolf Among Us - Episode 1: Faith\" entry. Steam app 250320 (\"The Wolf Among Us\") was used; the store list also has \"The Wolf Among Us Remastered\" (3884860) and \"The Wolf Among Us 2\" (1884870), which were not used. None of the 35 Steam achievements is hidden: each of the five episodes has five chapter achievements, an episode-complete achievement that gives the episode's name, and a Book of Fables achievement, so each episode is one chapter. StrategyWiki has a page at completion stage 0: Controls, Gameplay and Walkthrough are linked but not written; only its Table of Contents subpage exists, so nothing was used. fables.fandom.com answers the API under \"The Wolf Among Us\" with about 54 linked articles; names only were looked at, nothing copied."
